{"body":"## What this changes\n\nRolls back three pull requests of the issue 655 orchestrator build that are on master, at Clay's request (2026-11-20), so master is back where Ryan's issue-watcher work left off. `/sc:closeout` (#683) is kept. Reverted, newest first:\n\n- #684 move the agent-work-report skill into IronClaude (d7d645ddd)\n- #682 retire the old plan-approval gate (01e7a9e23). This restores the `issue-pipeline` command group and its tests (Ryan's Plan A #584 and Plan B #591), `WORKER-CONTRACT.md` rule WC-17 and its \"Issue pipeline duties\" section, and the first G2 rule of `launch-level-guard.sh` (source and plugin copy).\n- #681 the orchestrator design `docs/designs/orchestrator.md` (c2a139552)\n\nThe branch reverts all four and then re-applies #683 in a second commit.\n\n## What does not change\n\n- `/sc:closeout` (#683) stays. Its files are unchanged from master except `WORKER-CONTRACT.md` and `tests/skills/test_worker_contract.py`, which now hold both the restored WC-17 rules and the closeout never-as-worker entries, and `CHANGELOG.md`, which keeps only the closeout entry.\n- Otherwise only files #681, #682 and #684 touched change, each back to its state before #681.\n- #688 and #694, merged after them, are untouched (their files are identical to master). Nothing merged before #681 is affected.\n\n## Where the rolled-back work is kept\n\n- `clayphi/archive-orchestrator-655-20261120`: master at d7d645ddd, with #681 to #684.\n- Open PRs #686 and #690 stay as drafts; every unfinished build branch (`clayphi/issue-655-pr-b-*`, `clayphi/issue-655-spec`, `clayphi/orchestrator-655-hub`, `clayphi/issue-668*`) is pushed.\n\n## Tests\n\n`pytest tests/skills/test_closeout_protocol.py tests/skills/test_worker_contract.py tests/recommend/test_routing_refresh.py tests/issue_pipeline tests/cli/test_issue_pipeline_registered.py tests/hooks/test_launch_level_guard_worker.py tests/issue_watch`: 4063 passed.\n\nRefs #655\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOPOT5c88AAAABo8OTIQ","author":{"login":"chatgpt-codex-connector"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<!-- codex-pull-request-review-summary -->\n<!-- codex-review-state:v1 {\"code_review\":{\"commit_sha\":\"b9dbcc997fbf318b68b337cd0a2772a7303b0446\",\"has_any_findings\":false,\"has_unresolved_findings\":false,\"status\":\"completed\"},\"security_review\":{\"commit_sha\":\"b9dbcc997fbf318b68b337cd0a2772a7303b0446\",\"has_any_findings\":null,\"has_unresolved_findings\":null,\"status\":\"completed\"}} -->\n<!-- codex-security-review:v1 {\"blockingSeverityThreshold\":\"P0\",\"headSha\":\"b9dbcc997fbf318b68b337cd0a2772a7303b0446\",\"mergeGateEnabled\":false,\"pullRequestNumber\":700,\"repository\":\"IronbellyOrg/IronClaude\",\"status\":\"completed\"} -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Codex Review Summary</strong>: ✅ Completed</summary>\n\nThis comment shows the latest Codex review activity on this pull request.\n\n| Review | Status | Commit | Review trigger |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 📝 **Code Review** | ✅ **Completed** <relative-time datetime=\"2026-11-20T14:53:57.407806Z\">2026-11-20T14:53:57.407806Z</relative-time> | `b9dbcc9` | Manual request |\n| 🔒 **Security Review** | ✅ **Completed** <relative-time datetime=\"2026-11-20T15:02:54.012615Z\">2026-11-20T15:02:54.012615Z</relative-time> | `b9dbcc9` | Manual request |\n\n\n\n<details> <summary>ℹ️ About Codex in GitHub</summary>\n<br/>\n\n[Your team has set up Codex to review pull requests in this repo](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/settings/general). Reviews are triggered when you\n- Open a pull request for review\n- Mark a draft as ready\n- Comment \"@codex review\" or \"@codex security review\".\n\nCodex reacts with 👀 while any review is running, comments if it has suggestions, and reacts with 👍 once all reviews finish with no findings.\n\n</details>\n\n</details>","createdAt":"2026-11-20T14:46:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"",